title ALES79 — Lotus's soft-clip overdrive: ALES78's hard clip with its corner rounded
prompt Continue the autonomous loop — the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, self-approve the design round, send each finished increment to origin and xykj61, stop at custody gates.
think ALES78 (the hard-clip drive) opened the DRIVE family and named its successor by name: a soft-clip / overdrive with a knee. Lindy-first crux-first, that is the next durable rung — the overdrive every player reaches for, the warm rounded shoulder against the fuzz's sharp corner.
think The crux is one recognition, the family identity read at two knee positions: SOFT-CLIP DRIVE IS ALES78's HARD CLIP WITH ITS CORNER ROUNDED, and a hard clip is the soft clip whose KNEE sits AT the ceiling. Pull the knee below the ceiling and a half-slope shoulder opens; push it to the ceiling and the shoulder vanishes, leaving ALES78's pin.
think Shape: pre-gain ALES78's verbatim, then a piecewise-linear map on the boosted magnitude with the sign carried — clean below the knee (slope 1), half-slope shoulder knee→ceil (slope 1/2, knee + (m−knee)/2), pinned above (slope 0, reaching ceil exactly at m = 2·ceil − knee). Three straight integer segments meeting without a gap. Added one fault name, BadKnee (knee outside [1, ceil]); BadGain/BadCeiling/BadRange coincide with ALES78's by name.
obs Safe by construction exactly as the hard clip: the shape caps at ceil, so the shaped value lands in [−ceil, ceil] ⊆ the i16 rail BEFORE the write and the saturate is a documented no-op. The map is ODD (magnitude shaped, sign carried) → odd harmonics softened; MEMORYLESS → in place, no snapshot.
obs GREEN on the FIRST build across all seven laws — no RED. The strongest law proves the family bond directly: with knee == ceil the soft drive reproduces the REAL ALES78 hard drive byte-for-byte (both tools run in the one selftest), and a wide-knee overdrive is proven never louder than the hard pin at the same gain. tame_style_check clean.
loom witness=ales_soft_drive_witness laws=7 result=green build=first
