file lotus/README.md status line synced (ALES79 added, stamp refreshed) — front door current.
recommend keep-going ALES80 the DRIVE family's next corner — a wavefolder, where the excess past the ceiling reflects back rather than pinning (a mirror, not a wall). Mechanical, single-module, policy already written; no custody gate.
